<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>GEOMETRY ARENA</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Orbitron:wght@400;700;900&family=Noto+Sans+KR:wght@400;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@fortawesome/fontawesome-free@6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="css/style.css">
</head>
<body class="bg-slate-900 text-white overflow-hidden select-none font-sans">

    <!-- Main Game Container -->
    <div id="game-container" class="relative w-full h-screen flex flex-col">

        <!-- Background Grid -->
        <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0 opacity-20 pointer-events-none" 
             style="background-image: linear-gradient(#4f46e5 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(90deg, #4f46e5 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 40px 40px;">
        </div>

        <!-- Top HUD Area (Fixed Height to prevent overlap) -->
        <div class="relative z-20 w-full h-20 px-6 flex justify-between items-center bg-slate-900/80 backdrop-blur-sm border-b border-white/10 shadow-lg">
            
            <!-- Player HP -->
            <div class="w-1/3 max-w-xs">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-1">
                    <i class="fas fa-user-astronaut text-cyan-400"></i>
                    <span class="font-orbitron font-bold text-lg text-cyan-200">PLAYER</span>
                </div>
                <div class="w-full bg-gray-800 h-3 rounded-full overflow-hidden border border-gray-600">
                    <div id="player-hp-bar" class="h-full bg-cyan-500 transition-all duration-300" style="width: 100%;"></div>
                </div>
                <p id="player-hp-text" class="text-right text-xs text-cyan-300 mt-1">100 / 100</p>
            </div>

            <!-- Title & Turn Info -->
            <div class="flex-1 flex flex-col items-center justify-center px-4">
                <h1 class="text-2xl font-black font-orbitron tracking-tighter text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-400 to-pink-500">
                    GEOMETRY ARENA
                </h1>
                <div id="turn-indicator" class="mt-1 px-4 py-0.5 rounded-full border border-indigo-500 text-indigo-300 font-bold font-orbitron text-sm transition-colors duration-300">
                    READY
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Enemy HP -->
            <div class="w-1/3 max-w-xs text-right">
                <div class="flex items-center justify-end gap-2 mb-1">
                    <span class="font-orbitron font-bold text-lg text-pink-200" id="enemy-name">GEO-BOSS</span>
                    <i class="fas fa-shapes text-pink-500"></i>
                </div>
                <div class="w-full bg-gray-800 h-3 rounded-full overflow-hidden border border-gray-600 relative">
                    <div id="enemy-hp-bar" class="h-full bg-pink-600 transition-all duration-300 absolute right-0" style="width: 100%;"></div>
                </div>
                <p id="enemy-hp-text" class="text-left text-xs text-pink-300 mt-1">500 / 500</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Timer Line (Under HUD) -->
        <div class="w-full h-2 bg-gray-800 z-20">
            <div id="timer-bar" class="h-full bg-yellow-400 transition-all duration-100 ease-linear shadow-[0_0_10px_rgba(250,204,21,0.5)]" style="width: 100%;"></div>
        </div>

        <!-- Middle Arena Area -->
        <div class="flex-1 relative flex items-center justify-center w-full overflow-hidden p-4">
            
            <!-- Left Character (Player) -->
            <div id="char-player" class="absolute left-4 md:left-10 z-10 w-32 md:w-48 h-auto transition-transform duration-300">
                <!-- SVG Player Character -->
                <svg viewBox="0 0 200 200" class="w-full h-full drop-shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(6,182,212,0.6)]">
                    <defs>
                        <linearGradient id="gradPlayer" x1="0%" y1="0%" x2="100%" y2="100%">
                            <stop offset="0%" style="stop-color:#22d3ee;stop-opacity:1" />
                            <stop offset="100%" style="stop-color:#0ea5e9;stop-opacity:1" />
                        </linearGradient>
                    </defs>
                    <g class="char-body">
                        <!-- Head -->
                        <path d="M70,50 L130,50 L140,80 L60,80 Z" fill="url(#gradPlayer)" stroke="white" stroke-width="2"/>
                        <!-- Eye -->
                        <rect x="80" y="60" width="40" height="10" fill="#ccfbf1" class="animate-pulse"/>
                        <!-- Body -->
                        <path d="M60,85 L140,85 L120,160 L80,160 Z" fill="rgba(6,182,212,0.3)" stroke="#22d3ee" stroke-width="2"/>
                        <path d="M80,160 L70,190 L90,190 L95,160 Z" fill="#0ea5e9"/>
                        <path d="M120,160 L130,190 L110,190 L105,160 Z" fill="#0ea5e9"/>
                        <!-- Core -->
                        <circle cx="100" cy="110" r="15" fill="#22d3ee" class="animate-ping-slow"/>
                        <!-- Floating Shoulders -->
                        <path d="M50,90 L30,120 L60,110 Z" fill="#0ea5e9"/>
                        <path d="M150,90 L170,120 L140,110 Z" fill="#0ea5e9"/>
                    </g>
                </svg>
            </div>

            <!-- Canvas Container -->
            <div class="relative z-0 w-full max-w-4xl aspect-video bg-gray-900/60 backdrop-blur-sm border border-indigo-500/30 rounded-2xl shadow-2xl overflow-hidden cursor-crosshair mx-auto">
                <canvas id="game-canvas" class="w-full h-full block"></canvas>

                <!-- Mission Overlay (Transparent) -->
                <div id="mission-overlay" class="absolute top-4 left-1/2 transform -translate-x-1/2 pointer-events-none transition-all duration-300">
                    <div class="bg-gray-900/40 backdrop-blur-md px-8 py-3 rounded-full border border-white/20 shadow-lg text-center min-w-[300px]">
                        <h3 class="text-[10px] text-cyan-200 font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] mb-1">Current Mission</h3>
                        <p id="mission-text" class="text-xl font-bold text-white font-orbitron drop-shadow-md">WAITING...</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- In-Game Messages -->
                <div id="message-overlay" class="absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 transform -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 text-center pointer-events-none opacity-0 z-50 w-full">
                    <h2 id="msg-title" class="text-6xl font-black font-orbitron text-white drop-shadow-[0_5px_5px_rgba(0,0,0,0.8)] mb-2 tracking-tighter italic"></h2>
                    <p id="msg-subtitle" class="text-2xl text-cyan-300 font-bold drop-shadow-md"></p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Right Character (Enemy) -->
            <div id="char-enemy" class="absolute right-4 md:right-10 z-10 w-32 md:w-48 h-auto transition-transform duration-300">
                <!-- SVG Enemy Character -->
                <svg viewBox="0 0 200 200" class="w-full h-full drop-shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(236,72,153,0.6)]">
                    <defs>
                        <linearGradient id="gradEnemy" x1="0%" y1="0%" x2="100%" y2="100%">
                            <stop offset="0%" style="stop-color:#db2777;stop-opacity:1" />
                            <stop offset="100%" style="stop-color:#be185d;stop-opacity:1" />
                        </linearGradient>
                    </defs>
                    <g class="char-body">
                        <!-- Spiky Body -->
                        <path d="M100,20 L130,70 L180,50 L140,100 L180,150 L130,130 L100,180 L70,130 L20,150 L60,100 L20,50 L70,70 Z" 
                              fill="url(#gradEnemy)" stroke="#fbcfe8" stroke-width="2"/>
                        <!-- Inner Chaos -->
                        <path d="M100,60 L120,100 L100,140 L80,100 Z" fill="#831843"/>
                        <!-- Eye -->
                        <circle cx="100" cy="100" r="10" fill="#fff" class="animate-pulse"/>
                        <path d="M90,90 L110,110 M110,90 L90,110" stroke="#db2777" stroke-width="3"/>
                        <!-- Floating Bits -->
                        <rect x="150" y="30" width="10" height="10" fill="#db2777" class="animate-spin-slow"/>
                        <rect x="40" y="160" width="10" height="10" fill="#db2777" class="animate-spin-slow"/>
                    </g>
                </svg>
            </div>

        </div>

        <!-- Bottom Controls -->
        <div class="relative z-20 w-full py-4 flex justify-center bg-slate-900/50 backdrop-blur-sm border-t border-white/5">
            <button id="reset-btn" class="px-8 py-3 bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/20 text-white rounded-full font-bold transition-all border border-white/20 flex items-center gap-3 backdrop-blur-md shadow-lg group">
                <i class="fas fa-undo group-hover:-rotate-180 transition-transform duration-500"></i> 다시 그리기 (Reset)
            </button>
        </div>

        <!-- Intro/Game Over Modal -->
        <div id="game-modal" class="absolute inset-0 z-50 bg-slate-950/95 flex items-center justify-center backdrop-blur-md">
            <div class="text-center p-8 max-w-4xl border border-cyan-500/30 rounded-3xl bg-slate-900 shadow-[0_0_100px_rgba(6,182,212,0.2)]">
                <h1 class="text-7xl font-black font-orbitron text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-400 via-blue-500 to-purple-600 mb-2">
                    GEOMETRY ARENA
                </h1>
                <p class="text-xl text-gray-400 mb-8 font-light tracking-wide">수학적 정확도로 승부하는 리얼타임 배틀</p>
                
                <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-8 text-left mb-10">
                    <div class="bg-gray-800/50 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-cyan-500/20 hover:border-cyan-500/50 transition-colors">
                        <h3 class="text-cyan-400 font-bold text-xl mb-3 flex items-center gap-2">
                            <i class="fas fa-pen-nib"></i> ATTACK
                        </h3>
                        <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">
                            매 턴마다 주어지는 <strong>도형 미션</strong>(직각삼각형, 사각형 등)을 확인하고, 
                            캔버스에 정확하게 그리세요.<br>
                            <span class="text-cyan-200">정확도 70% 이상</span>이어야 데미지가 들어갑니다.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="bg-gray-800/50 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-pink-500/20 hover:border-pink-500/50 transition-colors">
                        <h3 class="text-pink-400 font-bold text-xl mb-3 flex items-center gap-2">
                            <i class="fas fa-shield-virus"></i> DEFENSE
                        </h3>
                        <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">
                            적이 공격하면 <strong>닮음 도형</strong>을 그리거나, 
                            떠다니는 도형 중 <strong>닮은 쌍</strong>을 찾아 클릭해야 합니다.<br>
                            <span class="text-pink-200">실패 시 큰 데미지</span>를 입습니다.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <button id="start-btn" class="w-full py-6 bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-600 to-indigo-600 hover:from-cyan-500 hover:to-indigo-500 text-white font-black text-2xl rounded-2xl shadow-xl transition-all transform hover:scale-[1.01] hover:shadow-cyan-500/25">
                    BATTLE START
                </button>
            </div>
        </div>

    </div>

    <script src="js/math-utils.js"></script>
    <script src="js/game.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
